As a corollary of Claim \ref{claim 4}, we have the following claim.
\begin{claim}\label{claim 5}
 $N_{G}(v)\cap N_{G}(y_{i})=\emptyset$ and $N_{G}(y_{i})\cap N_{G}(y_{j})=\emptyset$ for $1\leqslant i\neq j\leqslant l$.
